Merge branch \`harness/nyt-3\` into the base branch \`main\` from wherever \`main\` is checked out (not the ticket's worktree at /Users/me/.harness/worktrees/NYT-3), resolve trivial conflicts, then remove the worktree, and delete the merged branch.

When you are finished, call \`post_summary\` with what you did."
`;

