exports[`built-in run prompts conductorUpdatePrompt · no changes 1`] = `"Check on your children with \`list_tickets\` and handle anything waiting on you."`;

exports[`built-in run prompts conductorUpdatePrompt · changes with and without summaries 1`] = `
"Child ticket updates:
1. NYT-4 "Tokens x": in_progress → review
   Summary: Added tokens.
   Tests pass.
2. NYT-5 "Toggle": blocked → in_progress
3. NYT-6 "Docs": review → done

Handle each one: \`review_ticket\` children in review once their agent review is approved (or skipped), \`complete_ticket\` children you have approved, and answer blocked children with \`message_ticket\`. Call \`submit_for_review\` only when every child is done."
`;

